<title>UK: Merrill sets warrants on Wolters Kluwer.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on Wolters Kluwer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co has issued 300 thousand American-style call warrants, on Wolters Kluwer NV, lead manager Merrill Lynch International Ltd said on Wednesday. One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    190.00 DFL		PREMIUM	8.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     32.50 DFL		 GEARING	6.29 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   23.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	13.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  204.50 DFL</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
